  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 2nd level, a triggerman gains a moxie pool, effectively a representation of that legendary gunslinger swagger that allows a gunfighter who is \"in the zone\" to perform some truly outrageous stunts. A moxie pool begins play containing 0 moxie points, but has a maximum size of 4. Whenever the triggerman executes a technique with a Focus Change of 2, 3, or 4, he gains moxie points equal to one fewer than the number of focus points expended on that technique. A triggerman's talents (see Moxie Talents, below) interact with this pool. Some talents expend moxie points, while others grant a passive bonus based on how many points are presently in the pool.</p>\n<p>Each morning, the triggerman's moxie pool is set to 0 moxie points. This occurs whether or not he has rested, meditated, or otherwise taken care of himself.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/triggerman#toc6\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
